 "remarks": "Welcome to Linden Terrace! This lovely two-bedroom condo is tucked away in a quaint quiet community offering plenty of natural light and access to an in-ground pool. The unit features updated stainless steel appliances, convenient in-unit laundry, two generously sized bedrooms, and a full bath. Ideally located near the Merritt Parkway, shopping, schools, and local amenities. Enjoy easy access to Calf Pasture Beach and a quick trip to Metro-North, making commuting a breeze. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable, convenient living in Norwalk!",
